        <h3>Worth checking on-site</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><svg><use href="#i-check"/></svg> The dog shower is open access — remember to bring a towel for your dog.</li>
          <li><svg><use href="#i-check"/></svg> The car park fills up fast in July-August, so it's best to plan ahead.</li>
